# Consume @nhtio/* from the public npm registry.
#
# These packages are published to BOTH npmjs.org (public) and the private GitLab
# registry. Installs must use the npmjs.org copies: the CI supply-chain policy
# validates every lockfile tarball URL against npmjs.org's published metadata, so
# a lockfile pinned to GitLab URLs is rejected.
#
# This project-level pin overrides any machine-global @nhtio registry override
# (e.g. ~/Library/Preferences/pnpm/auth.ini), keeping the lockfile correct
# regardless of local developer config. Cross-publishing to the private GitLab
# registry is handled separately in .gitlab-ci.yml at publish time and is
# unaffected by this setting.
@nhtio:registry=https://registry.npmjs.org/
